            <div xml:id="m-42e5fec9-ccb4-4ea0-9d9a-643adb32c6c2">
              <lg xml:id="m-f66922da-2e04-49fb-a934-e64633450e59">
                <l xml:id="m-ad9b93dd-b8f5-4582-a146-bcb6980a507d" facs="#m-a08274f4-019d-406c-bb6a-b71573c6a9d3" label="ambiguous">855</l><l xml:id="m-54b3b073-4986-4028-b3aa-58b8991cdd7a" facs="#m-f551dbee-ddb6-435a-8930-824fa7eae5c7" label="text-like">Sunday within the Octave of the Ascension.</l><l xml:id="m-336659f1-aa43-4ffd-b398-59abe25a2347" facs="#m-7d119875-ea33-4124-93d6-686733cb4094" label="lyrics-like">a-vértas fá-ci-em tú-am a me, alle-lú¬ ia, al¬</l><l xml:id="m-95d04045-aac1-4b96-b770-ae6990a01add" facs="#m-a90cbbdb-3e64-426e-b66b-e4e9274b1c4d" label="ambiguous">ne</l><l xml:id="m-8ce78733-fa65-4980-ab47-8b2e03f055c4" facs="#m-e8d3cb15-fb20-4da6-9ace-891dbe2c6e9c" label="ambiguous">4-1-4-—</l><l xml:id="m-f2783845-8757-4c6d-b320-5d9c6acca093" facs="#m-ae3455f3-fd1a-443b-b5c0-6ee69c5a2c76" label="lyrics-like">lú- ia. Ps. Dóminus illuminá-ti-o mé¬a, “et sálus</l><l xml:id="m-aed3f66b-7f56-4a63-b955-fd7631019a2d" facs="#m-b4a7e768-4027-482f-847e-c8053aad8a98" label="ambiguous">le¬</l><l xml:id="m-e89000ed-4fc0-44b3-9dc3-62e703366aec" facs="#m-072f5587-2fef-4d61-8b25-0efcc4c4e7b1" label="lyrics-like">mé-a: quem timé- bo? Gló-ri-a Pátri. E u ou a e.</l><l xml:id="m-53be1d10-5baa-4c95-b62e-732baedfde10" facs="#m-36d70971-5136-4504-8cd8-3c342e189ce9" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-bc7508ad-129d-4a68-ac5f-cf541efc9196" facs="#m-f139de9c-5ab1-4185-919a-81666d2d4c3c" label="lyrics-like">Mnípotens sempitérne Deus, t tuae sincéro corde servire. Per Dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-c964fa59-8331-44de-8c2f-8d5c4316ccca" facs="#m-a752090b-735b-41e0-87b1-3f90d28c5881" label="lyrics-like">U fac nos tibi semper et devótam ] minum nostrum.</l><l xml:id="m-53cb5bdc-826e-45c7-9ac8-6d5799db7cd8" facs="#m-e54dec5a-c8e8-4d75-ae32-703817735fb8" label="lyrics-like">gérere voluntátem, * et majestáti</l><l xml:id="m-68dac310-fd8b-40ad-a973-81e828bcbf79" facs="#m-96ec3bee-01d3-41ed-8333-6d7281a1edd6" label="lyrics-like">Commemoration of the Octave of the Ascension. Collect. Concéde. p. 847.</l><l xml:id="m-79442103-1d3a-45d6-af5f-2d8165707834" facs="#m-a12f4f85-ea90-433c-8782-82fe63d932e4" label="ambiguous">Lectio Epistolae beati Petri Apostoli. r. Petr. 4. b.</l><l xml:id="m-0a153397-6f53-4f26-8b86-eb8bd97b5f96" facs="#m-39cbc217-7d5f-4fb9-bca3-c324c69ccb36" label="lyrics-like">vAríssimi: Estóte prudéntes, et altérutrum illam administrántes,</l><l xml:id="m-954fe81e-fd02-44e3-bca4-6c8fed41ae31" facs="#m-e083518c-5223-493f-9fc1-f0e20b6c417c" label="lyrics-like">vigiláte in oratiònibus. Ante</l><l xml:id="m-d4032519-a38e-4835-9ce8-8a30589d4da7" facs="#m-a52e3be2-be43-4c0b-83ba-2c8eb333eeee" label="lyrics-like">sicut boni dispensatóres multifór¬</l><l xml:id="m-be390b16-b50a-47f0-8d9e-1fa3b60f88d1" facs="#m-0a7cf780-1525-442b-a00a-742987632505" label="lyrics-like">mis grátiae Dei. Si quis lóquitur,</l><l xml:id="m-d6f94dff-eba0-4a8a-be36-298e2d2dc91c" facs="#m-e2e4cb68-d57b-4d1f-bfe2-03ffe85de281" label="lyrics-like">ómnia autem, mútuam in vobis¬</l><l xml:id="m-0cd1ca10-5152-4c74-baf1-9555799b7b60" facs="#m-cb5c31fb-a3cc-4da5-9590-4bf11378d9e4" label="lyrics-like">metípsis caritátem continuam ha¬</l><l xml:id="m-a307628c-d190-4a73-ba1f-6c0e24cbb6a9" facs="#m-8fa64c88-1772-4036-9862-04bbfd4ab6e1" label="lyrics-like">quasi sermónes Dei: si quis mini¬</l><l xml:id="m-d163ef6f-9c29-4235-ab3d-eda6141ed611" facs="#m-722a2639-b191-4c7f-afed-e8ba27e269cd" label="lyrics-like">béntes: quia cáritas óperit multitú¬</l><l xml:id="m-0311c185-0c00-4893-a3da-847814f341ad" facs="#m-985519af-5797-4b09-ba51-0de109186d23" label="lyrics-like">strat, tamquam ex virtú̂te, quam</l><l xml:id="m-fd26e4cd-2d57-4644-9478-31dfe0509f59" facs="#m-0a3f7547-8d34-4ce9-bcc3-3a8da97abd6b" label="lyrics-like">dinem peccatórum. Hospitáles in¬</l><l xml:id="m-e5ec17b5-6595-4728-90ce-a8cf67c1e4ea" facs="#m-a94811c5-64e2-4cb2-82c9-8bfd49bb853d" label="lyrics-like">administrat Deus: ut in ómnibus</l><l xml:id="m-349f148d-7d72-406d-8635-9